The training, data preparation, and runtime patch are derived from the PAS
reproduction at jiayin-nvidia/cosmos-rl commit
4a5105c3cd6815dc3333df2de75771f050c5fc8d. The runtime base is NVIDIA Cosmos RL
commit 89b1fdd89441964868a8767ee964e1e41a85ea68 (Apache-2.0).

The Cosmos reranker, SigLIP2 loader, and PAS evaluator are derived from the
NVIDIA rerank_experiment sources captured in that reproduction commit.
Their source checkout was at c06e589 with local PAS modifications.
Only the Cosmos scorer and dependencies used by this recipe are included.

The supplied step-8000 adapters were fine-tuned from the clean Cosmos3-Nano
VLM export on PAS V3.1 using the recipe in README.md. Model artifacts retain
the Cosmos model's OpenMDW-1.1 terms; see checkpoints/step8000/LICENSE.model.
The model's origin is https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Cosmos3-Nano.
